<name>Heater &amp; Air Conditioner System</name>
<para id="RM000002BPV007X" category="J" type-id="802CK" name-id="5229I-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Control Panel Circuit</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000002BPV007X_05" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BZO00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>This circuit consists of the air conditioner control assembly and air conditioner amplifier assembly. When the air conditioner control assembly is operated, it sends signals to the air conditioner amplifier assembly using LIN communication. If communication becomes abnormal, the air conditioner amplifier assembly does not operate even when the air conditioner control assembly is operated.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002BPV007X_06" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BZP00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E145612J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002BPV007X_07" type-id="51" category="05">
