<testgrp id="RM000002BPV007X_08_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BZQ00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuse (ECU-IG NO.2)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the ECU-IG NO.2 fuse.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ECU-IG NO.2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BPV007X_08_0010" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002BPV007X_08_0015" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002BPV007X_08_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BZR00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness or Connector (Air Conditioner Control Assembly - Power Source)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the air conditioner control assembly connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between each terminal of the vehicle side wire harness connector of the air conditioner control assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E144400J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt> 2(IG+) - 5(GND)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 to 14 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002BPV007X_08_0011" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002BPV007X_08_0016" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
